                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I first found this game on mobile (IOS) and enjoyed it a lot. When I found it on Steam I was SUPER happy, as its much more enjoyable playing with a controller than it is holding your finger on the screen. \r\n\r\nThe game has a great amount of replay-ability, as you have to GRIND your way through the levels to get your ship upgraded enough to be able to make it through later levels. Its a great pick up and play game that you play for 5 mins or an hour or more if you have time.",
